Z||000000||Turkey on Rye||10-23-2001||04:36 PM||||I have been wanting to get some new wheels for my car, but i am just gettin confused about the whole thing. I own a 86 gt and i know that my front tires are smaller than my rear (p205-front p215-rear), will  a set of 15 x 7" wheels with a 5 on 100 bolt pattern work with those tires???<BR>Some guy told me that any 15 x 7' wheel with a 5 on 100 pattern will work, is this true?  Any help would be awesome. Thanx a bunch! ||||reg||1
